hu later sought to negotiate with Sun Ce, Yan Yu was sent as the envoy. However, his proposal to split Jiangdong between them angered Sun Ce, who killed him on the spot.","jp":"厳白虎の弟。自らの武勇を頼みとし、孫策が江東を征討した際には先鋒を務めて迎え撃つも、程普や蒋欽らに敗れた。その後、厳白虎が孫策との和睦を図った際、使者として派遣され孫策と交渉したが、江東の地を二分する提案をして孫策の怒りを買い、斬殺された。","kr":"엄백호의 동생이다. 자신의 용맹을 믿고 손책이 강동을 정벌할 때 선봉으로 맞섰으나, 정보와 장흠 등에게 패했다. 이후 엄백호가 손책과 담판을 짓고자 엄여를 사신으로 보내 손책과 교섭하게 하였으나, 강동 땅을 양분하자는 제안을 꺼내 손책의 분노를 사 참살당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10342","remark":"","surname":"严","surnameTc":"嚴","surnameEn":"Yan","surnameJp":"厳","surnameKr":"엄","surnameOther":"","name":"舆","nameTc":"輿","nameEn":"Yu","nameJp":"輿","nameKr":"여","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"严舆","power":"WJ10341","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1054","gender":"0","rule":"61","force":"78","wise":"44","politics":"20","charm":"29","will":"35","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"10","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"1","willTalent":"2","weaponMaster":"26/26/56/74/66/12/32/26","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1003605","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3700","battleSoulPoint":"6000","debateSoulPoint":"1900","strategy":"1002908","strategy2":"1002305","professions":"3/3/0/1/0/1/1/0/0/0/1/2/2/0/1/0/2/1/0/1/0/1/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"6","loyalty":"225","reputation":"150","evaluate":"-4000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"145","show":"184","death":"196","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"2","weapon":"WP12006","armor":"WP1002705","helmet":"WP10233